  "terrainName": "basic-desert",
  "description": "What: the dragon's HOVER on a building (CE-3490 BA-4, BA-5). On basic-desert a 'Timber House' (timber-house template, SW corner at (300, 300)) with 'Hut Man' inside, and a 'Brick Shed' (shed template, brick, at (300, 420)) with 'Shed Man' inside. 'Dragon' (40 m up at (100, 300)) is ordered AirPlatformStrike (Building) on the timber house; 'Brick Dragon' (at (100, 420)) on the brick shed. Judge: the Dragon breathes on the timber house from a low hover and the house burns \u2014 Hut Man burns from the building's fire and dies; the Brick Dragon never breathes (its strike fails at once: brick does not burn) and Shed Man is never hurt."
 },
